{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>API.RawQuery</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"elpi","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Elpi","href":"../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"API","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"RawQuery","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>This module lets one generate a query by providing a RawData.term directly. Like <code>Compile.query</code>, the functions that make a query return it or its first error, and its warnings</p>","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-compile_ast\"><a href=\"#val-compile_ast\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> compile_ast : \u000A  <span><a href=\"../Compile/index.html#type-program\">Compile.program</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><a href=\"../Ast/index.html#type-query\">Ast.query</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>(<span><a href=\"../State/index.html#type-t\">State.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"../State/index.html#type-t\">State.t</a>)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>(<a href=\"../Compile/index.html#type-query\">Compile.query</a>, <a href=\"../Error/index.html#type-t\">Error.t</a>)</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Stdlib</span>.result</span> * <span><a href=\"../Error/index.html#type-warning\">Error.warning</a> list</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>with the possibility to update the state in which the query will run</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-compile_term\"><a href=\"#val-compile_term\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> compile_term : \u000A  <span><a href=\"../Compile/index.html#type-program\">Compile.program</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>(<span><a href=\"../State/index.html#type-t\">State.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"../State/index.html#type-t\">State.t</a> * <a href=\"../Ast/Term/index.html#type-t\">Ast.Term.t</a>)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>(<a href=\"../Compile/index.html#type-query\">Compile.query</a>, <a href=\"../Error/index.html#type-t\">Error.t</a>)</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Stdlib</span>.result</span> * <span><a href=\"../Error/index.html#type-warning\">Error.warning</a> list</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>generate the query ast term with a function. The resulting term is typed, spilled, etc</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-compile_raw_term\"><a href=\"#val-compile_raw_term\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> compile_raw_term : \u000A  <span><a href=\"../Compile/index.html#type-program\">Compile.program</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>(<span><a href=\"../State/index.html#type-t\">State.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"../State/index.html#type-t\">State.t</a> * <a href=\"../Data/index.html#type-term\">Data.term</a> * <a href=\"../Conversion/index.html#type-extra_goals\">Conversion.extra_goals</a>)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>(<a href=\"../Compile/index.html#type-query\">Compile.query</a>, <a href=\"../Error/index.html#type-t\">Error.t</a>)</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Stdlib</span>.result</span> * <span><a href=\"../Error/index.html#type-warning\">Error.warning</a> list</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>generate the query term by hand, the result is used as is</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-term_to_raw_term\"><a href=\"#val-term_to_raw_term\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> term_to_raw_term : \u000A  <span><a href=\"../State/index.html#type-t\">State.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><a href=\"../Compile/index.html#type-program\">Compile.program</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?ctx</span>:<span><a href=\"../RawData/index.html#type-constant\">RawData.constant</a> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ast</span>.Scope.Map.t</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">depth</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><a href=\"../Ast/Term/index.html#type-t\">Ast.Term.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <a href=\"../State/index.html#type-t\">State.t</a> * <a href=\"../Data/index.html#type-term\">Data.term</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>typechecks only if ctx is empty</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-global_name_to_constant\"><a href=\"#val-global_name_to_constant\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> global_name_to_constant : <span><a href=\"../State/index.html#type-t\">State.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"../RawData/index.html#type-constant\">RawData.constant</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>raises Not_found</p></div></div>"}